# The Dockerfile only installs packages and builds OpenSSL from source; it never COPYs or ADDs
# anything from the repo. The source tree reaches the container through the compose bind mount
# (./eap_gpl_code_eap772 -> /build), not the build context. So exclude everything from the build
# context to keep it tiny and fast (otherwise docker sends the whole multi-GB repo to the daemon
# on every build).
*
!Dockerfile
